('nav0','1 · 亲手交换','1 · Swap by hand'),('nav1','2 · 边与路径','2 · Edges and paths'),('nav2','3 · 逐对合并','3 · Merge pairs'),('nav3','4 · 先预测','4 · Predict first'),('nav4','5 · Python 与边界','5 · Python and limits'),
('s0t','一次交换，与一条交换链','One swap versus a chain'),
('s0e','这一步要回答：tars 与 arts 不相似，为什么仍能同组？下标从 0 开始。相似指两个字符串完全相同，或在其中一个字符串中交换两个不同位置的字母后相同。tars → rats 交换位置 0、2；rats → arts 交换位置 0、1。tars 与 arts 在位置 0、1、2 都不同，一次交换改不了三个位置。','Why can tars and arts share a group despite not being similar? Indices start at 0. Similar means identical, or equal after swapping letters at two distinct positions in one string. tars → rats swaps positions 0 and 2; rats → arts swaps positions 0 and 1. tars and arts differ at positions 0, 1 and 2, so one swap cannot fix them.'),
('contract','输入 strs 的每个词都是其他词的字母异位词：字母及其数量相同，顺序可不同。共有 1–300 个词，每个长 1–300，只有小写英文字母。求通过若干条相似关系连通的组数；孤立词自己成一组。重复词合法，不必交换也相似。','Every word in strs is an anagram of every other word: the same letters with the same counts, possibly in a different order. There are 1–300 words of length 1–300, using lowercase English letters. Count groups connected through similarity relations; an isolated word is a group. Duplicate words are valid and similar without any swap.'),
('handTask','操作：先点「交换 0 ↔ 2」，再点「交换 0 ↔ 1」。固定目标 arts，观察当前词和不同位置；撤销后应回到上一词。这里试的是交换规则，不是提交代码。','Try “Swap 0 ↔ 2”, then “Swap 0 ↔ 1”. Keep the target arts fixed and watch the word and mismatch positions. Undo should restore the previous word. This explores the swap rule; it does not run the submission.'),
('swap02','交换 0 ↔ 2','Swap 0 ↔ 2'),('swap01','交换 0 ↔ 1','Swap 0 ↔ 1'),('undo','撤销一次交换','Undo one swap'),('reset','重置','Reset'),
('handRead','当前词 {word}；目标 arts；不同位置：{diff}。{relation}','Current word {word}; target arts; mismatch positions: {diff}. {relation}'),
('direct','两词直接相似。','These words are directly similar.'),('notDirect','两词不直接相似。','These words are not directly similar.'),('none','无','none'),('handHistory','已做交换：{h}','Swaps made: {h}'),('noSwaps','尚未交换','no swaps yet'),
('s1t','先把所有相似关系画出来','Start with every similarity edge'),
('s1e','这一步要回答：如何准确地数「组」？把每个输入位置当作一个顶点（词的身份）；两词直接相似时连一条边。路径是连续的边，连通分量是能通过路径互达的最大顶点集合，也就是本题的一组。tars—rats—arts 是一个分量，star 没有边，单独成组，所以官方第一例是 2。第二例 omv—ovm 只差交换位置 1、2，答案是 1。','How can we count groups precisely? Treat each input position as a vertex, the identity of that word occurrence. Join two vertices by an edge if their words are directly similar. A path is a sequence of edges. A connected component is a maximal set of vertices joined by paths: one group here. tars—rats—arts is one component; star has no edges and stands alone, giving 2 in the first official example. In the second, omv—ovm swaps positions 1 and 2, giving 1.'),
('wrong','错误捷径：只与本组第一个词比较。输入 [tars, rats, arts] 时，arts 与代表 tars 不相似，会被错误分开；但 rats 是连接它们的桥。要求组内任意两词都直接相似，也会犯同样错误。','Tempting shortcut: compare only with the first word of each group. For [tars, rats, arts], this separates arts because it is not similar to representative tars. But rats connects them. Requiring every pair inside a group to be directly similar makes the same mistake.'),
('baseline','正确基线：逐对检查并保存所有边，再用广度优先搜索（反复访问尚未访问的相邻顶点）走完整个分量。每次从一个未访问顶点出发，就发现一组。graph 的每个小列表存一个顶点的邻居；seen 是已访问编号的集合。sum 把每个比较的 True 计为 1、False 计为 0，得到不同位置数 d。队列 queue 存待扩展顶点，head 是下一项的位置，避免从列表头删除元素。','Correct baseline: test every pair, store all edges, then use breadth-first search, repeatedly visiting unvisited neighbors, to explore each component. Starting from each unvisited vertex discovers one group. Each list inside graph stores one vertex’s neighbors; seen is the set of visited IDs. sum counts each True comparison as 1 and False as 0 to obtain the mismatch count d. queue stores vertices to explore, and head indexes the next one rather than deleting from the front.'),
('baselineCode','展开：显式图基线 Python','Expand: explicit-graph baseline Python'),
('baselineCost','n 是词数，L 是词长。基线逐对逐字比较，耗时 O(n²L)，最坏存 O(n²) 条邻接记录，另需 O(n) 访问标记和队列。n=300 时有 44,850 对；L=300 时至多检查 13,455,000 个字符位置。下一步仍检查所有对，节省的是边的存储，并非消除两两比较。','Let n be the number of words and L their length. The baseline scans characters for each pair in O(n²L) time, storing O(n²) adjacency entries in the worst case plus O(n) visited flags and queue space. At n=300 there are 44,850 pairs; at L=300 at most 13,455,000 character positions are checked. The next method still tests every pair; it saves edge storage rather than removing pairwise comparison.'),
('s2t','边可以忘记，连接关系必须留下','Forget edges, retain connectivity'),
('s2e','这一步要回答：不保存所有边，如何保留分组？先推导直接相似的检查：一次交换最多影响两个位置，所以有三个或更多不同位置一定失败。零个不同位置说明相同。若恰好两个位置不同，因输入保证字母数量相同，这两个字母必定交叉匹配，交换即可。只有一个不同位置不可能出现在合法异位词中。','How can we retain groups without storing all edges? First derive the direct test. A swap affects at most two positions, so three or more mismatches must fail. Zero mismatches means identical. With exactly two mismatches, the anagram guarantee forces the two letters to cross-match, so swapping works. Exactly one mismatch is impossible for valid anagrams.'),
('derive','从 [tars], [rats], [arts], [star] 四组出发。检查 tars—rats 后，两个组变一个，4 → 3；tars—arts 不相似，保持 3；之后 rats—arts 把 arts 接入，3 → 2。并查集就是跟踪这些不相交集合的数据结构。parent[x] 指向同组的另一个编号；沿指针走到指向自己的根。find(x) 找这个代表。合并只连接两个不同的根；size[root] 记录该根的成员数，小组挂到大组。','Start with four sets: [tars], [rats], [arts], [star]. Testing tars—rats joins two sets, 4 → 3. tars—arts fails, leaving 3. Later rats—arts brings arts into the set, 3 → 2. A disjoint-set structure tracks these separate sets. parent[x] points toward a representative; following pointers reaches a root that points to itself. find(x) locates that root. Merge only distinct roots; size[root] counts members, and the smaller set attaches to the larger.'),
('invariant','不变量（每次操作后仍成立的事实）：处理完任意前缀的词对后，并查集恰好表示「已处理的相似边」形成的连通分量，也就是通过这些边的路径互相可达的组。初始没有边，单点组正确。不相似的对不加边；相似的对若根不同，就恰好连接两分量，组数减 1；若根相同，已有路径，新边不会减少组数。所有词对处理完，所有相似边都已考虑，留下的组数就是答案。','Invariant, a fact preserved after each operation: after any prefix of pair tests, the sets are exactly the connected components of the processed similarity edges: the groups joined by paths of those edges. Initially there are no edges, so singleton sets are correct. A dissimilar pair adds no edge. A similar pair with distinct roots joins exactly two components, reducing the count by 1. Equal roots mean a path already exists, so another edge cannot reduce the count. After all pairs, every similarity edge has been considered, so the remaining count is the answer.'),
('traceTask','选预设会从头重启本实验。逐对检查，观察当前两词的橙色下划线（不同位置）、合并前后组数及累计记录，再后退一步核对。编号代表输入位置，重复词也保留各自编号。','Changing the preset restarts this experiment. Test pairs and watch orange underlines (mismatch positions), the before/after group counts, and the accumulated ledger. Step back to check restoration. IDs are input positions; duplicate words keep distinct IDs.'),
('presetLabel','输入预设','Input preset'),('preset0','官方例 1','Official example 1'),('preset1','官方例 2','Official example 2'),('preset2','单个词','One word'),('preset3','重复词','Duplicates'),('preset4','三个位置不同','Three mismatches'),('preset5','通过中间词连接','A connecting word'),('preset6','重复字母','Repeated letters'),
('sim','教学模拟：每帧是一对词检查及可能合并之后；保留全部词对。为解释而列出所有不同位置，Python 在第三个不同位置就停止。这里不执行 Python。快照和历史的存储不属于提交的辅助空间。','Teaching simulation: each frame follows a pair test and any merge; every pair is retained. It lists all mismatch positions for explanation, while Python stops at the third. It does not execute Python. Snapshot and history storage are separate from submission auxiliary space.'),
('input','strs = {words}','strs = {words}'),('prev','退回上一对','Back one pair'),('next','检查下一对','Test next pair'),('end','查看全部词对后','Show all pairs processed'),
