('pair','刚检查编号 {i}、{j}；不同位置 {diff}；组数 {before} → {after}。{action}','Just tested IDs {i}, {j}; mismatch positions {diff}; groups {before} → {after}. {action}'),
('merged','直接相似，根不同：合并。','Directly similar, different roots: merge.'),('already','直接相似，根相同：已有路径，不再减数。','Directly similar, same root: already connected, no decrement.'),('rejected','不直接相似：不加边。','Not directly similar: no edge added.'),('word','编号 {i}: {word}','ID {i}: {word}'),
('groupsTitle','当前分组：括号内为词的编号与内容','Current sets: word IDs and contents'),('group','根 {root}，成员数 {size}：{members}','Root {root}, size {size}: {members}'),('parentsTitle','当前 parent 指针（编号 → 父编号）','Current parent pointers (ID → parent ID)'),
('parentHelp','根指向自己。size 只在根处有意义；find 会把访问到的指针跳向祖父，让以后更快到根。这改变指针，不改变分组。','A root points to itself. size is meaningful only at roots. find redirects visited pointers toward their grandparents to shorten later searches; this changes pointers, not membership.'),
('ledgerTitle','累计词对检查记录','Accumulated pair-test ledger'),('empty','尚无检查记录。','No pairs tested yet.'),
('s3t','迁移：重复词会多出一组吗？','Transfer: does a duplicate add a group?'),
('s3e','这一步要回答：输入 ["abc", "bac", "bca", "bca"] 的最终组数是多少？每个位置起初单独成组。注意 abc 与 bca 有三个不同位置，而最后两个词完全相同。先选择，再揭晓；这里与上面的模拟互相独立。','How many groups remain for ["abc", "bac", "bca", "bca"]? Each position starts in its own set. Notice that abc and bca differ at three positions, while the last two words are identical. Choose before revealing; this exercise is independent of the simulation above.'),
('predictionLegend','最终组数？','Final group count?'),('option0','2 组：只看 abc 与 bca','2 groups: compare only abc and bca'),('option1','1 组：考虑全部连接路径','1 group: account for all connecting paths'),('option2','0 组：每条相似边都减一次','0 groups: decrement for every similarity edge'),('reveal','揭晓并解释','Reveal and explain'),('await','先选一个答案，再点击揭晓。','Choose an answer, then reveal.'),('correct','预测正确。','Correct prediction.'),('incorrect','再检查连接路径和根是否相同。','Check the connecting paths and whether roots already match.'),
('answer','答案是 1。abc—bac 交换 0、1；bac—bca 交换 1、2；两份 bca 相同。它们通过路径全部相连，即使 abc 与 bca 不直接相似。四个单点组只需三次成功合并；根已相同的相似对不再减数，所以不会变成 0。','The answer is 1. abc—bac swaps 0 and 1; bac—bca swaps 1 and 2; the two bca words are identical. Paths connect all four even though abc and bca are not directly similar. Four singleton sets need only three successful merges. A similar pair whose roots already match does not decrement the count, so it cannot become 0.'),
('s4t','把分组不变量落实到 Python','Turn the grouping invariant into Python'),
('s4e','这一步要回答：每个可见变化对应哪段提交代码？下面是官方 Python3 接口 Solution.numSimilarGroups(strs)，返回整数，不修改输入。并查集是分组记录器，根是组的代表，parent 是朝代表走的指针；它不要求组内任意两个词直接相似。','Which submission lines cause each visible change? Below is the official Python3 interface, Solution.numSimilarGroups(strs), returning an integer without mutating input. The disjoint-set structure tracks groups; a root represents a group, and parent points toward that representative. Members of a group need not all be directly similar.'),
('map1','similar：累计不同位置；超过 2 立即失败；最终接受 0 或 2。若去掉异位词保证，ab 与 cd 虽然只差两位却无法交换得到，不能只数位置。','similar counts mismatches, rejects immediately above 2, and finally accepts 0 or 2. Without the anagram guarantee, ab and cd differ at two positions but cannot be made equal by a swap: counting alone would fail.'),
('map2','find：while 沿 parent 向根走；令指针指向祖父以缩短路径。a != b 才合并，否则已有连接。比如 rats—arts 把两个不同根连接，groups 从 3 减为 2。','find follows parent pointers with a while loop, redirecting each to its grandparent to shorten paths. Merge only when a != b; otherwise the connection exists already. For rats—arts, distinct roots join and groups falls from 3 to 2.'),
('map3','size：总让小组挂到大组；若一个成员的深度增加，它所在组的大小至少翻倍，所以深度最多 log₂n。size 只在根处读取，旧根的数值无需清空。双层 for 枚举每个无序词对一次。','size attaches the smaller group to the larger. Whenever a member gains a level, its group size at least doubles, so depth is at most log₂n. Only root sizes are read; old root sizes need not be cleared. The nested for loops enumerate each unordered pair once.'),
('cost','n 为词数、L 为词长。给出保守上界：每对扫描至多 L 个位置，并做至多两个 O(log n) 的 find，总时间 O(n²(L + log n))，另有 O(n) 初始化；在 n,L ≥ 1 的合法范围已包含在该上界中。路径缩短还能改善摊还开销，但这里不依赖它来证明上界。parent 与 size 各长 n，辅助空间 O(n)，不存邻接表，不使用递归栈。','For n words of length L, a conservative bound is O(n²(L + log n)) time: each pair scans at most L positions and performs at most two O(log n) finds. O(n) initialization is included for the valid n,L ≥ 1 domain. Path shortening improves amortized work further, but the bound does not rely on that. parent and size each have n entries, so auxiliary space is O(n). No adjacency list or recursive stack is stored.'),
('boundaries','边界：单个词返回 1；相同词归一组；[abc, bca] 虽是异位词但要两次交换，返回 2；[aab, aba, baa] 都能一次交换，返回 1。空列表和非异位词不在官方输入范围内。测试会实际执行此 Python；页面的逐帧图仅用于解释。','Boundaries: one word returns 1; identical words form one group; [abc, bca] are anagrams but need two swaps, so return 2; [aab, aba, baa] are connected by single swaps, so return 1. Empty lists and non-anagrams are outside the official input domain. Tests execute this Python; the page trace is an explanatory simulation.'),
('copy','复制 Python','Copy Python'),('download','下载 solution.py','Download solution.py'),('source','查看完整 Python 源码','View complete Python source'),('copied','源码已复制。','Source copied.'),('fallback','自动复制不可用：源码已全选，请手动复制。','Automatic copy unavailable: the source is selected for manual copying.'),('manualCopy','完整源码（已全选，可用系统复制快捷键）','Complete source (selected; use the system copy shortcut)'),
('related1','继续：#815 用广度优先搜索展开可达集合','Continue: #815 expands reachable sets with breadth-first search'),('related2','对照：#765 用环给交换次数建立下界','Compare: #765 uses cycles to bound the number of swaps'),
